<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">be my baby</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;They hadnâ€™t had any time alone over the past two weeks, as Adoraâ€™s husband was uncharacteristically present. Adora resumed her duties as his housewife and property. Catra resumed her duties as Finnâ€™s full-time nanny, with an additional job from Adora's husband - keeping an eye on his wife.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Adora gently stopped Catraâ€™s head with her hand, running a thumb over her cheekbone. â€œI missed you,â€ she whispered.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;â€œIâ€™m right here,â€ Catra promised, delighting in Adoraâ€™s sharp cry at the first flick of Catraâ€™s tongue.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Catra kept an eye on Adora - just not in the way her husband had intended upon her employment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;---&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Title from "Be My Baby" by The Ronettes.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>sapphwriter</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
      <dc:subject>
        <rdf:Bag>
          <rdf:li>Fanworks</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Explicit</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>She-Ra and the Princesses of Power (2018)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora/Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora &amp; Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Finn | Adora/Catra Child (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>1960s</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Alternate Universe</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Smut</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Fluff</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>F/F</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>No Archive Warnings Apply</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>TW: Comphet</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Implied/Referenced Abuse</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora is married because Comphet sucks</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Mutual Pining</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Alternate Universe - 60's</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora is a Housewife</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra is a live-in Nanny</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>I think you can guess what's gonna happen</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>This is the spiciest thing I've ever written</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Implied/Referenced Drug Use</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Blood and Injury</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Verbal Abuse</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Complete</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Bag>
